        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--sm\" style=\"padding-top: 0;\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2\" style=\"gap: var(--pp-space-12); align-items: start;\">\n\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">Grooming & Care · 1.5 kg</span>\n            <h1 style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Pet Household Laundry Detergent</h1>\n            <p class=\"pp-lead\">Antibacterial laundry safe for baby clothes</p>\n                        <div class=\"pp-trust-row\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-6);\">\n              <span class=\"pp-badge pp-badge--amber\">MOQ 1,000</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Sample on request</span>\n              <span class=\"pp-badge\">Quote in 1 business day</span>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div style=\"aspect-ratio: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f8fafc); border-radius: var(--pp-radius-xl); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-200); overflow: hidden;\">\n              <img src=\"/assets/img/products/pet-household-laundry-detergent.png?v=2\" alt=\"Pet Household Laundry Detergent\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; padding: var(--pp-space-4);\" onerror=\"this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=&quot;font-size: 6rem; color: var(--pp-300);&quot;>🐾</div>'\">\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500); margin-top: var(--pp-space-2); text-align: center;\">DEKOBIO · 1.5 kg</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n                        <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.keyFeatures\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Self-designed for pet-soiled textiles</h3>\n\n\n              <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Pet-stain breakdown</strong> &#8212; camellia saponins break down organic stains (urine, feces, vomit, dander) without bleaching.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Antibacterial + mite-removal in one wash</strong> &#8212; single cold-water cycle at 30&#176;C, no pre-soak required.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1);\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">Plant-based fragrance</strong> &#8212; no synthetic musks that pets smell and reject bedding after washing.</li>\n\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700);\">HE machine compatible</strong> &#8212; low-suds formula designed for high-efficiency front-loaders.</li>\n\n\n              </ul>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.ingredients\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Main ingredients &#8212; and what each one powers</h3>\n\n\n              <table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <tbody>\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Camellia Seed Extract</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Pet-stain breakdown + antibacterial &#8212; core active.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\" border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Fabric Softening Agent</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Pet-comfort after wash &#8212; reduces stiffness.</td>\n\n\n\n                  <tr style=\"\">\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 6px 6px 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pp-teal-700); vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap;\">Plant-Based Fragrance</td>\n\n\n\n                    <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: var(--pp-ink-700); vertical-align: top;\">Pet-acceptance &#8212; no synthetic musks.</td>\n\n\n\n\n                </tbody>\n\n\n              </table>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n\n\n\n            <div class=\"pp-card\">\n\n\n              <h3 data-i18n=\"products.labReports\" style=\"margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-2);\">Third-party lab reports</h3>\n\n\n              <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: var(--pp-text-sm);\">\n\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Multi-Effect-Wash-Antibacterial-Test.pdf\" download=\"Multi-Effect-Wash-Antibacterial-Test.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Antibacterial lab report</span>\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">2.2 MB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n\n\n                    </span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n\n\n                  </a>\n\n\n\n                </li>\n\n\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-100);\">\n\n\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Multi-Effect-Wash-Mite-Control-Test.pdf\" download=\"Multi-Effect-Wash-Mite-Control-Test.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Mite-Control lab report</span>\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">2.1 MB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n\n\n                    </span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n\n\n                  </a>\n\n\n\n                </li>\n\n\n\n                <li style=\"padding: 6px 0 0;\">\n\n\n\n                  <a href=\"/assets/img/certs/Multi-Effect-Wash-Ingredient-Report.pdf\" download=\"Multi-Effect-Wash-Ingredient-Report.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--pp-space-3); text-decoration: none; color: var(--pp-ink-800);\">\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128196;</span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 0;\">\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"display: block; color: var(--pp-teal-700); font-weight: 600;\">Ingredient Disclosure</span>\n\n\n\n                      <span style=\"font-size: var(--pp-text-xs); color: var(--pp-ink-500);\">2.2 MB &#183; PDF</span>\n\n\n\n                    </span>\n\n\n\n                    <span style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-600); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap;\">Download &#8595;</span>\n\n\n\n                  </a>\n\n\n\n                </li>\n\n\n              </ul>\n\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
